  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_auto_hide_if_empty" version_id="3000070" version_string="3.0.0"><![CDATA[If faceted search is enabled, it is possible to hide or fade out the custom fields or their individual options which don't match any results.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_auto_reload" version_id="1000073" version_string="1.0.0"><![CDATA[If enabled, list of resources will be automatically reloaded with each change of filter form.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_cache_ttl" version_id="2000070" version_string="2.0.0"><![CDATA[The number of seconds to cache the search results. The cache is invalidated whenever a new entry matching the search result is created or an entry is updated, so this setting usually should not be changed unless instructed otherwise. Set to 0 to disable the cache.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_color_similarity_index" version_id="1000073" version_string="1.0.0"><![CDATA[The index controls color search similarity algorithm. Index of 0 means exact color match, index of 1 is the minimum detectable change for human eye. The difference between white and black is about 440.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_custom_field_location" version_id="1010173" version_string="1.1.1"><![CDATA[Choose where to put the custom fields in Filters form.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_default_distance_unit" version_id="3000071" version_string="3.0.0"><![CDATA[The default unit used in location-related form elements. Applies only if <b>[AL] Location field</b> add-on is installed.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_disable_default_filter_field" version_id="2000070" version_string="2.0.0"><![CDATA[]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_faceted_search" version_id="3000070" version_string="3.0.0"><![CDATA[If enabled, selection-type custom fields will show the number of items matching the option, dynamically updating the number of items available each time filters change.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_filter_icon_location" version_id="2010072" version_string="2.1.0"><![CDATA[When off-canvas menu is enabled, an icon will be added using which users can open the menu.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_filter_location" version_id="1000070" version_string="1.0.0"><![CDATA[Sets the default setting for filter location for all resource categories. The setting can be modified for each category separately.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_filterable_lists" version_id="3050070" version_string="3.5.0"><![CDATA[If enabled, the custom fields of "Multiple-choice drop down" and "Drop down selection" will allow filtering the list by keywords. Useful for larger lists but may be not optimal on mobile devices.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_hide_distance_unit" version_id="3020670" version_string="3.2.6"><![CDATA[If checked, the distance unit will not be shown to users in the forms.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_keyword_search" version_id="1030070" version_string="1.3.0"><![CDATA[If enabled, users will be able to search resource title and message for keywords along with filtering the resources by custom fields in the same form. Uses XenForo search engine to execute the search.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_license_key" version_id="1000071" version_string="1.0.0"><![CDATA[The license key you got from us when purchasing the product. Please check Licensing Details page in your Services if you don't have your license key.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_max_limit" version_id="1030070" version_string="1.3.0"><![CDATA[The number of resources to show in filtered views. Bigger limits may have performance impact on large boards. Default value is 10000. Put 0 for unlimited.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_multi_category_field_mode" version_id="2010070" version_string="2.1.0"><![CDATA[The setting defines, if the forms on Resource index and Search pages should show the custom fields which are common by all categories(shared), or all custom fields that are available in all categories being searched .]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_multi_prefix_search" version_id="2000070" version_string="2.0.0"><![CDATA[If enabled, users will be able to filter the resources based on multiple prefixes.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_number_formatting_exclusion_list" version_id="3010071" version_string="3.1.0"><![CDATA[Custom fields, which should not be formatted as a number (e.g. a numeric field representing years). List custom field IDs separated by a comma.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_off_canvas_filter" version_id="2010072" version_string="2.1.0"><![CDATA[If enabled, mobile views will have a filter icon next to the search icon or replacing the default Filters link clicking which will open an off-canvas menu with the filter form. All other forms (above resource list, sidebar, popup) will automatically disappear in the mobile view.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_tag_search" version_id="1030070" version_string="1.3.0"><![CDATA[If enabled, users will be able to filter the resources based on tags along with filtering the resources by custom fields. XenForo search engine is used to execute the search.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.alrf_total_count_indicator" version_id="3000070" version_string="3.0.0"><![CDATA[If enabled, the filter form will show the total number of items matching with each change of the form.]]></phrase>
